 access to the Sullivan Aquatic Center with valid ACCESS credentials, and the center regularly offers lap-swim and water-walking lanes.","source_url":"https://www.scu.edu/recreation/about/history/facility-history/","source_title":"Campus Recreation Facility History","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Lane availability changes when water polo or other groups are scheduled; check the aquatics schedule first.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"bellomy-field-track","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Bellomy Field and Track","title":"Walk or run by Bellomy Field","subtitle":"Campus Recreation outdoor field and track","notes":"Use the track for an easy daylight lap or meet a friend nearby, while keeping clear of scheduled intramural games, club practices, and reserved field areas.","short_summary":"An outdoor recreation area with a running track around the field.","evidence_claim":"Bellomy Field includes a running track that became more consistently accessible after the field’s 2012 renovation.","source_url":"https://www.scu.edu/recreation/about/history/facility-history/","source_title":"Campus Recreation Facility History","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Field availability depends on reservations and games; consult the field schedule before organized use.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"locatelli-student-activity-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Paul L. Locatelli, S.J. Student Activity Center","title":"Check the Locatelli Center calendar","subtitle":"Student Activity Center","notes":"Finish by checking what is scheduled in the activity center and noting a future concert, dance, or pre-game gathering that fits your interests and access status.","short_summary":"A campus activity venue for gatherings and scheduled events.","evidence_claim":"The Paul L. Locatelli, S.J. Student Activity Center has a 6,000-square-foot gathering hall that accommodates dances, concerts, and pre- and post-game activities.","source_url":"https://www.scu.edu/bulletin/undergraduate/chapter-1-university-mission/campus.html?c=1734554647","source_title":"SCU Undergraduate Bulletin 2026–27: Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Access depends on the scheduled event; review the relevant organizer’s event details before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
